{"meta":{"id":"selector","category":"it/syntax/css/selector","title":"선택자 (자식 · 자손) · CSS","subtitle":"(CSS)","summary":"#id · .class · [속성] · > 자식 · 공백 자손 · :hover · nth-child","tags":["css","f-selector"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>CSS</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">선택자 (자식 · 자손) · CSS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> #id · .class · [속성] · &gt; 자식 · 공백 자손 · :hover · nth-child</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">선택자</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">css</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">#title { }                      /* id */\r\n.btn { }                        /* class */\r\ninput[type=&quot;text&quot;] { }          /* 속성: input 중 type 이 text */\r\n.menu &gt; li { }                  /* 자식: 바로 아래 li 만 */\r\n.menu li { }                    /* 자손: 안에 있는 모든 li */\r\n.btn:hover { }                  /* 상태 (가상 클래스) */\r\nli:nth-child(2n) { }            /* 짝수 번째 */\r\nh1, h2 { }                      /* 여러 개 */</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">자식 vs 자손</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기호</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">이름</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">범위</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>A &gt; B</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">자식</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">A 바로 아래 한 단계의 B 만</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>A B (공백)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">자손</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">A 안에 있는 모든 단계의 B</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모는 '자손 ( &gt; )' / '자식 (공백)' 으로 반대로 적혀 있었다 — &gt; 가 자식, 공백이 자손.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> jQuery › 선택자 · filter (같은 선택자 사용)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/css/selector/selector","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"css","title":"CSS","path":"it/syntax/css"},{"id":"selector","title":"선택자","path":"it/syntax/css/selector"}],"hasImage":false}